{
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      }
    ]
  },
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Service Graph",
      "type": "nodeGraph",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "queryType": "serviceMap",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 16,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "edges": {
          "mainStatUnit": "short"
        },
        "nodes": {
          "mainStatUnit": "short"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Service Graph Request Rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(traces_service_graph_request_total[5m])) by (client, server)",
          "legendFormat": "{{client}} -> {{server}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "Requests/sec"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Service Graph Latency (p95)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(traces_service_graph_request_server_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, client, server))",
          "legendFormat": "{{client}} -> {{server}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "Latency (p95)"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Service Graph Error Rate",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "mimir"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(traces_service_graph_request_failed_total[5m])) by (client, server) / sum(rate(traces_service_graph_request_total[5m])) by (client, server)",
          "legendFormat": "{{client}} -> {{server}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "custom": {
            "axisLabel": "Error Rate"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Information",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 24
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "## Service Graph Dashboard\n\nDashboard ini menampilkan Service Graph yang di-generate oleh Tempo dari traces.\n\n### Cara Menggunakan:\n1. Generate traffic cross-service: `curl http://localhost:8080/api/users-with-profile/1`\n2. Tunggu beberapa saat untuk Tempo memproses traces dan mengirim metrics ke Prometheus\n3. Service Graph akan otomatis muncul di panel atas\n\n### Metrics:\n- **Service Graph**: Visualisasi dependencies antar services\n- **Request Rate**: Jumlah request per detik antar services\n- **Latency (p95)**: Latency percentile 95 antar services\n- **Error Rate**: Persentase error antar services\n\n### Dokumentasi:\n- [Grafana Service Graph](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/datasources/tempo/service-graph/)\n- [Configure Tempo Data Source](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/datasources/tempo/configure-tempo-data-source/)",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "style": "dark",
  "tags": ["services", "service-graph", "topology", "tempo"],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "Service Graph Dashboard",
  "uid": "service-graph",
  "version": 1,
  "weekStart": ""
}
